# Does it learn to be wary? A fresh robot. Six times someone claps and then shakes it (2 s later).
# It should learn that a bang comes before rough handling ("learn: bang -> rough handling") and,
# when it only hears a clap afterwards, expect it (expect_threat): freeze, duck, look scared.
duration 7:00
clock 14:00
seed 22
room_light on
every 0:45 from 0:30 until 4:20 clap 0 0.9
every 0:45 from 0:32 until 4:22 shake 1.5
at 5:10 clap 0 0.9
at 5:50 clap 0 0.9
at 6:30 clap 0 0.9
